class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> reverse_iterator<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Iter1<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> lhs,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> reverse_iterator<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Iter2<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> decltype<span class=\"br0\">(</span>rhs.<span class=\"me1\">base</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> lhs.<span class=\"me1\">base</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> </td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(constexpr since C++17)</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the distance between two iterator adaptors.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> lhs, rhs\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> iterator adaptors to compute the difference of\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs.<span class=\"me1\">base</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> lhs.<span class=\"me1\">base</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">operator<span class=\"sy2\">-</span></span> returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs.<span class=\"me1\">base</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">